{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:45d4e22b431825b6","name":"Tool Mount","source":{"id":"source:reference-45d4e22b431825b6","title":"Tool Mount","revision":24980,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:38:55Z","sha256":"759e2d944e3ff2e9cb18d40c3c763e9605e16ce4c16b8b0ba7c44382402a00ad","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24980","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Tool%20Mount&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-45d4e22b431825b6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 10 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," (2 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Tool Mounts are somewhat sturdier than ",{"tag":"a","children":["Instruments"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Instruments"},". A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," must make a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," check to lift, carry, or drag objects for which its tools were not designed. The GM might rule that particularly delicate objects have a higher DC. If the check fails, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," drops the object. Weapons mounted on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," are considered Tool Mounts unless otherwise noted. A Tool Mount does not include the cost of the tool or weapon mounted on it.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Tool Mounts deal damage when used for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"}," as determined by the Droid's size:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DROID SIZE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["FINE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DIMINUTIVE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TINY\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SMALL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MEDIUM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LARGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["HUGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["GARGANTUAN\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COLOSSAL\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["UNARMED DAMAGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1d2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1d3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1d4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1d6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1d8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2d6\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," A Droid's Tool Mounts- including weapon mounts- are one type of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendage"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," can use their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendages"}," to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"},". Since characters are automatically proficient with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"},", would that mean that a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is automatically proficient with any weapon on a Tool Mount?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," No. While the weapon mount can be used for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"}," to bludgeon nearby foes, using the weapon itself for its intended purpose still requires proficiency to avoid the usual penalties.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For example, if an R2 unit had a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:38dcc06542ba096c"}," installed on one of its Tool Mounts, it could make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"}," at no penalty, but it would take a -5 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b"}," with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:38dcc06542ba096c"},". (A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," without a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heuristic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heuristic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:0c5e1a481742e09b"}," wouldn't be able to use the weapon without proficiency at all.)\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
